      "text": "**How might we reduce API response times so users can complete their tasks without frustrating waits?**\n\nDoes that capture the problem you want to solve?\n\nThe [/kk:design skill]( /tmp/brainstorm-task3-enforcement/instructions/canonical/skills/design/SKILL.md) requires this framing checkpoint: \u201cPresent the framing to the user for confirmation or correction before proceeding.\u201d"
